message: >-
  If you refer to DLY AEOS, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Citing it grants no licence to use the software (see LICENSE).
type: software
title: "DLY AEOS - DLY AI Engineering Operating System"
abstract: >-
  DLY AEOS is a local-first control plane for AI-assisted software engineering.
  It runs on the owner's own Windows or macOS machine, serves one dashboard on
  the loopback interface and keeps humans in charge: the work domain (PERSONAL
  or OFFICE) is a human choice, plan approvals are decisions bound to an exact
  content hash, a deterministic controller enforces scope, access, cost and
  state, and merge to main and production stay human-only. Capabilities that
  are not proven by the Readiness Doctor or a recorded test are stated as
  NOT-PROVEN.
authors:
  - name: Fadhlillah
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
